     <property name="plainText">
      <string>rawioRender converts a .drawio (diagrams.net) file into an image (.jpg or .png).

Select:
- the input .drawio file;
- the output image file and format;
- the scale factor to increase the output image resolution.

The scale parameter controls image quality and is useful for generating high-resolution diagrams for documentation and reports.</string>
